  "body": "Extend `camcraft-gcode` (#2217) with dialect profiles for the remaining built-in milling post processors.\n\n## Scope\n- Add Siemens 840D support (`assets/posts/sinumerik.cps`): `%_N_..._MPF` headers, `G700`/`G710` unit words, `T.. D.. M6`, `CYCLE832(...)`, `G41 NORM`/`G42 NORM` refusal, and `;` comments.\n- Refuse ambiguous Sinumerik `G70`/`G71` unit switches by name with the line number (`sinumerik.cps` uses `G700`/`G710`).\n- Add Heidenhain DIN/ISO `.I` support (`assets/posts/heidenhain.cps`): `%NAME G71 *` / `G70` headers, `N.. *` block numbers, `T.. G17 S..`, separate `I+.. J+..` absolute center blocks, `G247 Q339=..` presets, `G200`/`G205`/`G206`/`G207` + `M99` cycles, `G62`, `FUNCTION DWELL TIME..`, and `;` comments.\n- Add Mazak support (`assets/posts/mazak.cps`): `MOTON S..` and `MOTOFF` spindle blocks.\n- Add Doosan DNM support (`assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`): `G5.1 Q1 Rx`/`G5.1 Q0`, `M10`/`M11` rotary clamp/unclamp, and `M88`/`M89` coolant words.\n- Ensure `grblhal`, `tinyg`, `carvera`, `tormach`, and `haas` dialect options (`G64 P..`, `G187`, `G30`) parse cleanly or refuse unsupported options by name.\n\nDepends on #2217.\n\nDone means: Tests parse programs from all four dialects into `cl::Toolpath` chains and refuse dialect mismatches (such as Sinumerik `G70`/`G71`) with the 1-based line number.\n\nPart of #2213\n",
